                      "label":  "Project Abstract  (150 words max)",
                      "value_cell":  "A23:X23; A24:X24; A25:X25",
                      "value":  "This project investigates the distribution and concentration of microplastics within urban river systems. By analyzing water samples from three major metropolitan sites, we aim to establish a baseline for pollution levels and identify primary source points for local remediation strategies."
                  },
                  {
                      "label":  "Specific Aims / Research Questions",
                      "value_cell":  "A27:X27; A28:X28",
                      "value":  "1. Quantify microplastic density per liter. 2. Determine the polymer composition of collected samples. 3. Assess correlation with storm-water runoff events."
                  },
                  {
                      "label":  "Methodology / Approach",
                      "value_cell":  "A30:X30; A31:X31",
                      "value":  "Utilizing field collection via plankton nets followed by laboratory analysis using Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR) to identify synthetic polymer types."
